<title>USA: Mississippi Senate approves $120 mln college GOs.</title>
<headline>Mississippi Senate approves $120 mln college GOs.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mississippi Senate has approved a $120 million general obligation bond bill for higher education, a legislative aide said Thursday.</p>
<p>The proposal would raise $70 million for repairs and renovations at eight public universities and $50 million for repair work at junior colleges.</p>
<p>It now heads to the House.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
